        "slc_2e4c9655f36969f3e39cb866d662426f51fbbba71108990b47a3c9aedf543236"
      ],
      "text": "Documented limits include a plaintext-at-rest sidecar at ~/.agentcookie/cookies-plain.db, a loopback-only CDP port that same-user processes can read, no live key rotation (wizard re-run required), and unread Linux extra-profile Chrome SQLite."
