      "text": "A recorded 2026-05-19 dry run of the closed-beta installer on a clean Mac mini concluded it was not ready for the first invite, citing blockers including broken tarball extraction, missing --code/--pair-url passthrough, and a key-file hostname mismatch that silently broke syncing."
